{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝要刑罰亞蘭和以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["論大馬士革的默示：",{"text":"看哪，大馬士革已被廢棄，不再為城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必變作亂堆。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞羅珥的城邑已被撇棄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必成為牧羊之處；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羊在那裏躺臥，無人驚嚇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮不再有保障；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大馬士革不再有國權；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞蘭所剩下的","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必像以色列人的榮耀消滅一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是萬軍之耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"到那日，雅各的榮耀必至枵薄；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他肥胖的身體必漸瘦弱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必像收割的人收斂禾稼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用手割取穗子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像人在利乏音谷拾取遺落的穗子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其間所剩下的不多，好像人打橄欖樹－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在儘上的枝梢上只剩兩三個果子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在多果樹的旁枝上只剩四五個果子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華－以色列的上帝說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["當那日，人必仰望造他們的主，眼目重看以色列的聖者。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他們必不仰望祭壇，就是自己手所築的，也不重看自己指頭所做的，無論是木偶是日像。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["在那日，他們的堅固城必像樹林中和山頂上所撇棄的地方，就是從前在以色列人面前被人撇棄的。這樣，地就荒涼了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"因你忘記救你的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不記念你能力的磐石；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，你栽上佳美的樹秧子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"插上異樣的栽子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽種的日子，你周圍圈上籬笆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又到早晨使你所種的開花；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但在愁苦極其傷痛的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所收割的都飛去了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["敵國都被擊敗"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"唉！多民鬨嚷，好像海浪匉訇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦奔騰，好像猛水滔滔；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦奔騰，好像多水滔滔；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但上帝斥責他們，他們就遠遠逃避，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又被追趕，如同山上的風前糠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如暴風前的旋風土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["到晚上有驚嚇，未到早晨他們就沒有了。這是擄掠我們之人所得的分，是搶奪我們之人的報應。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}